The '''Fishing Bag''' was a [[Bag]] that could store [[Fishing Bait]]s and Fish. It could be accessed from the [[SkyBlock Menu]] and was unlocked at {{CollectionLink|Raw Cod 3}}. Bait stored in the '''Fishing Bag''' was consumed automatically upon successfully reeling in a Fishing Rod.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Fishing Bag''' was unlocked at {{Coll|Raw Cod 3}}.
